WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:00.400
Joining us

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:00.800
now, a

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.402
top adviser to Ukrainian

00:00:02.402 --> 00:00:03.837
President Volodymyr Zelenskiy.

00:00:03.837 --> 00:00:06.206
Igor Joschka is with us.

00:00:06.206 --> 00:00:08.108
Igor, thanks for taking the time tonight.

00:00:08.108 --> 00:00:08.975
We heard President

00:00:08.975 --> 00:00:10.010
Zelensky say today

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:11.311
that 20, 23 will be

00:00:11.311 --> 00:00:12.912
the year of our victory.

00:00:12.912 --> 00:00:14.114
You are also hearing, though,

00:00:14.114 --> 00:00:15.815
American and Western leaders

00:00:15.815 --> 00:00:17.183
who are talking about bracing

00:00:17.183 --> 00:00:17.751
for this war

00:00:17.751 --> 00:00:20.720
to drag on potentially for years.

00:00:21.121 --> 00:00:22.989
Do you have any frustration

00:00:22.989 --> 00:00:24.257
that those leaders

00:00:24.257 --> 00:00:27.360
seem to doubt the ability of Ukraine

00:00:27.694 --> 00:00:28.561
to make good

00:00:28.561 --> 00:00:30.330
on what Zelensky is promising

00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:34.067
to wrap this up in 2023

00:00:34.934 --> 00:00:35.268
you know

00:00:35.268 --> 00:00:38.338
I remember some leaders experts so-called

00:00:39.105 --> 00:00:41.975
were saying exactly a year ago

00:00:41.975 --> 00:00:43.910
that Ukraine will not withstand

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:45.078
more than three.

00:00:45.078 --> 00:00:48.181
Okay let's say five or seven days,

00:00:48.481 --> 00:00:49.549
two weeks.

00:00:49.549 --> 00:00:53.219
Now we have 366 days of war

00:00:53.253 --> 00:00:55.255
not only You can withstand it.

00:00:55.255 --> 00:00:56.122
Not only we,

00:00:56.122 --> 00:00:57.323
we managed to do it

00:00:57.323 --> 00:00:58.825
to withstand the aggressive,

00:00:58.825 --> 00:01:00.060
but managed to fight back.

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:02.328
And almost 50% of Ukrainian territory

00:01:02.562 --> 00:01:03.530
which was captured

00:01:03.530 --> 00:01:04.831
after the open aggression

00:01:04.831 --> 00:01:06.933
has been already released.

00:01:06.933 --> 00:01:08.368
We will be doing this this year.

00:01:08.368 --> 00:01:10.737
Definitely our aim, our will.

00:01:10.770 --> 00:01:12.839
That's what really President is saying

00:01:12.839 --> 00:01:14.340
to have happy victorious.

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:15.842
20, 23.

00:01:15.842 --> 00:01:17.043
But in order to get this,

00:01:17.043 --> 00:01:18.478
we need the support

00:01:18.478 --> 00:01:19.412
and we need the support

00:01:19.412 --> 00:01:20.180
in terms of weapons.

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:21.081
First of all,

00:01:21.081 --> 00:01:22.215
because Ukraine

00:01:22.215 --> 00:01:23.349
can start counter-offensive

00:01:23.349 --> 00:01:25.518
if only we have enough

00:01:25.585 --> 00:01:27.587
supply of artillery

00:01:27.587 --> 00:01:29.189
including that long range

00:01:29.189 --> 00:01:31.291
with enough ammunition,

00:01:31.291 --> 00:01:33.393
battle tanks and armored vehicles

00:01:33.660 --> 00:01:35.762
and air defense to protect the skies

00:01:35.762 --> 00:01:37.764
and the territory of Ukraine provided

00:01:37.797 --> 00:01:38.364
what we have.

00:01:38.364 --> 00:01:39.866
It will definitely

00:01:39.866 --> 00:01:42.068
we have all the possibilities to we

00:01:42.302 --> 00:01:42.969
we have the will

00:01:42.969 --> 00:01:43.169
and the

00:01:43.169 --> 00:01:45.305
courage of Ukrainian armed forces.

00:01:45.305 --> 00:01:45.972
We have the will

00:01:45.972 --> 00:01:47.874
and strength of our president well,

00:01:47.874 --> 00:01:48.575
the will and desire

00:01:48.575 --> 00:01:49.943
of the Ukrainian people.

00:01:49.943 --> 00:01:51.811
So in order not to speculate

00:01:51.811 --> 00:01:53.580
about the let's unite

00:01:53.580 --> 00:01:54.247
all the efforts

00:01:54.247 --> 00:01:55.815
of the international community

00:01:55.815 --> 00:01:57.283
to help Ukraine intervene.

00:01:57.283 --> 00:01:58.318
I do want to say

00:01:58.318 --> 00:01:59.052
President Biden

00:01:59.052 --> 00:02:01.888
did just say something about those F-16s.

00:02:02.088 --> 00:02:04.424
You talked about defending from the air.

00:02:05.058 --> 00:02:06.326
We're trying to turn that around

00:02:06.326 --> 00:02:07.093
so we can get that,

00:02:07.093 --> 00:02:08.828
so folks can see that

00:02:08.828 --> 00:02:10.096
and we can get a response

00:02:10.096 --> 00:02:10.830
from you to that.

00:02:10.830 --> 00:02:12.031
So I just want to let people know

00:02:12.031 --> 00:02:13.166
that's coming up.

00:02:13.166 --> 00:02:14.234
I do want to ask you,

00:02:14.234 --> 00:02:16.102
Ukraine's military intelligence

00:02:16.102 --> 00:02:17.203
chief says

00:02:17.203 --> 00:02:18.538
that this spring is going

00:02:18.538 --> 00:02:20.607
to bring decisive battles.

00:02:20.940 --> 00:02:22.408
Give us a sense of what is in

00:02:22.408 --> 00:02:23.476
store here in the

00:02:23.476 --> 00:02:24.544
coming weeks and months.

00:02:27.514 --> 00:02:28.581
Well, you know, Russia will

00:02:28.581 --> 00:02:30.617
be definitely trying to

00:02:30.617 --> 00:02:32.051
to have a response

00:02:32.051 --> 00:02:34.287
because throughout the last half a year,

00:02:34.287 --> 00:02:36.089
Russia was only failing on the

00:02:36.089 --> 00:02:38.057
on the battlefield, on the ground,

00:02:38.057 --> 00:02:39.792
didn't manage to get any

00:02:39.792 --> 00:02:41.761
any major cities or towns.

00:02:41.761 --> 00:02:42.228
That's why

00:02:42.228 --> 00:02:44.063
there will be really intensive.

00:02:44.063 --> 00:02:45.598
And that's what they really are like

00:02:45.598 --> 00:02:46.933
on the east of Ukraine

00:02:46.933 --> 00:02:48.001
and on the city of Baltimore,

00:02:48.001 --> 00:02:48.968
the Kremlin.

00:02:49.068 --> 00:02:50.803
They'll be trying to have some offensive

00:02:50.803 --> 00:02:52.939
from the south of Ukraine.

00:02:52.939 --> 00:02:54.541
And we have to understand

00:02:54.541 --> 00:02:56.109
that this will definitely happen.

00:02:56.109 --> 00:02:58.311
But when they fail, not if,

00:02:58.311 --> 00:02:59.746
but when they fail,

00:02:59.746 --> 00:03:00.947
we will definitely have

00:03:00.947 --> 00:03:02.282
the counter-offensive

00:03:02.282 --> 00:03:04.384
because these reforms will be the last

00:03:04.384 --> 00:03:05.852
Russian advance possible.

00:03:05.852 --> 00:03:07.887
They're also running out of

00:03:07.887 --> 00:03:08.988
not even the manpower

00:03:08.988 --> 00:03:10.690
because they have enough manpower,

00:03:10.690 --> 00:03:12.725
but then they stand in somehow

00:03:12.725 --> 00:03:14.961
why and for what purpose they are doing

00:03:14.961 --> 00:03:15.995
so definitely

00:03:15.995 --> 00:03:18.398
Ukraine should not lose the momentum

00:03:18.398 --> 00:03:19.232
it should

00:03:19.232 --> 00:03:21.901
develop on this very positive dynamics

00:03:21.901 --> 00:03:24.837
we had in the second half of

00:03:24.837 --> 00:03:26.072
the last year.

00:03:26.072 --> 00:03:26.973
So definitely being

00:03:26.973 --> 00:03:28.241
a little bit difficult for us

00:03:29.275 --> 00:03:29.642
when we

00:03:29.642 --> 00:03:30.977
will start the gun program

00:03:30.977 --> 00:03:32.612
so that it will be much easier.

00:03:32.612 --> 00:03:34.414
Igor, I do want to listen now

00:03:34.414 --> 00:03:36.683
to what President Biden just said.

00:03:36.716 --> 00:03:37.417
These are remarks

00:03:37.417 --> 00:03:39.919
just released by ABC News.

00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:42.422
He said that the U.S.

00:03:42.422 --> 00:03:45.425
is providing what Ukraine needs now, but

00:03:45.425 --> 00:03:48.027
this is what he said about F-16s.

00:03:49.162 --> 00:03:50.763
We know the Germans are now sending tanks

00:03:50.763 --> 00:03:51.898
and after the US said

00:03:51.898 --> 00:03:54.067
it would send Abrams tanks as well,

00:03:54.601 --> 00:03:55.802
But we know President Zelensky

00:03:55.802 --> 00:03:58.037
continues to say what he really needs

00:03:58.037 --> 00:03:59.572
are F-16s.

00:03:59.572 --> 00:04:01.207
Will you send F-16s?

00:04:01.207 --> 00:04:01.941
Look,

00:04:02.642 --> 00:04:04.244
we're sending him

00:04:04.244 --> 00:04:05.912
what our

00:04:05.912 --> 00:04:08.248
seasoned military thinks he needs now.

00:04:08.848 --> 00:04:09.983
He needs tanks,

00:04:09.983 --> 00:04:11.050
he needs artillery,

00:04:11.050 --> 00:04:12.118
he needs air defense,

00:04:12.118 --> 00:04:14.187
including another high marks.

00:04:14.187 --> 00:04:15.388
There are things he needs

00:04:15.388 --> 00:04:17.457
now that we're sending him

00:04:17.457 --> 00:04:18.524
to put him in a position

00:04:18.524 --> 00:04:18.858
to be able

00:04:18.858 --> 00:04:20.693
to make gains this spring,

00:04:20.693 --> 00:04:22.428
in this summer, going into the fall.

00:04:22.428 --> 00:04:23.830
You don't think he needs F-16s now?

00:04:23.830 --> 00:04:25.365
No. He doesn't have six years now.

00:04:25.365 --> 00:04:26.099
Is that a never

00:04:27.567 --> 00:04:28.201
look?

00:04:28.668 --> 00:04:31.137
First of all, the idea that

00:04:32.338 --> 00:04:34.307
we know exactly what's going to be needed

00:04:34.307 --> 00:04:35.642
a year or two or three from now,

00:04:35.642 --> 00:04:38.111
but there is no basis upon which

00:04:38.611 --> 00:04:39.812
there is a rationale,

00:04:39.812 --> 00:04:41.748
according to our military now,

00:04:41.748 --> 00:04:43.383
to provide F-16s.

00:04:43.383 --> 00:04:44.784
But you're not ruling it out?

00:04:44.784 --> 00:04:46.352
I am ruling out for now.

00:04:46.352 --> 00:04:47.086
For now.

00:04:47.353 --> 00:04:47.754
Igor,

00:04:47.754 --> 00:04:51.591
he says Ukraine doesn't need F-16s now.

00:04:51.824 --> 00:04:54.594
What is your reaction to that?

00:04:55.461 --> 00:04:57.697
My reaction is

00:04:57.697 --> 00:04:59.332
we got the F-16 is now

00:04:59.332 --> 00:05:01.034
there will be no pilots to

00:05:01.034 --> 00:05:01.734
to fly them

00:05:01.734 --> 00:05:03.803
because our pilots have to be trained

00:05:03.970 --> 00:05:06.606
well before we obtain the F-16s.

00:05:06.873 --> 00:05:07.974
And this is what exactly

00:05:07.974 --> 00:05:09.976
Ukraine has started to achieve.

00:05:10.009 --> 00:05:10.310
All right.

00:05:10.310 --> 00:05:12.645
You said several countries

00:05:12.645 --> 00:05:14.580
announced that they will be ready

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:14.947
to go

00:05:14.947 --> 00:05:15.882
to give trainings

00:05:15.882 --> 00:05:18.718
for Ukrainian pilots to muster the F-16s.

00:05:18.985 --> 00:05:20.620
So will be training.

00:05:20.620 --> 00:05:21.421
We'll be going on

00:05:21.421 --> 00:05:23.423
with our counter-offensive.

00:05:23.423 --> 00:05:24.857
We will be

00:05:24.857 --> 00:05:27.126
looking forward to deliver an F-16,

00:05:27.193 --> 00:05:28.661
by the way, not only F-16.

00:05:28.661 --> 00:05:29.862
There are some other types

00:05:29.862 --> 00:05:31.130
of fighter jets

00:05:31.130 --> 00:05:32.865
in the European countries as well,

00:05:32.865 --> 00:05:35.101
which can also be provided to Ukraine.

00:05:35.101 --> 00:05:35.568
You know,

00:05:35.568 --> 00:05:36.369
someone told that

00:05:36.369 --> 00:05:37.570
there will be no possibility

00:05:37.570 --> 00:05:39.872
to have long artillery systems to Ukraine

00:05:39.872 --> 00:05:41.574
versus that. No, we have them.

00:05:41.574 --> 00:05:43.710
I mean, Igor, let me ask you.

00:05:43.776 --> 00:05:45.778
Easier Igor makes more sense.

00:05:46.045 --> 00:05:47.046
Igor makes more sense

00:05:47.046 --> 00:05:48.081
to train

00:05:48.081 --> 00:05:48.781
for a plane

00:05:48.781 --> 00:05:49.682
that you definitely know

00:05:49.682 --> 00:05:50.883
you're going to get.

00:05:50.883 --> 00:05:52.685
And right now, he's ruling it out

00:05:55.321 --> 00:05:57.623
if you're trying to sit still play

00:05:57.990 --> 00:05:59.992
and the country spends money

00:05:59.992 --> 00:06:02.462
for training your soldiers for F-16,

00:06:02.695 --> 00:06:03.963
why on earth

00:06:03.963 --> 00:06:05.832
this country will spend money

00:06:05.832 --> 00:06:07.800
if the F-16 will never be

00:06:07.800 --> 00:06:08.701
delivered to Ukraine?

